<item><title>Johannesburg council to elect mayor as coalition deal gives ANC bloc control</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/johannesburg-council-to-elect-mayor-as-coalition-deal-gives-2c295b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/johannesburg-council-to-elect-mayor-as-coalition-deal-gives-2c295b/</guid><category>South Africa</category><description>A reported four-party pact includes the ANC, ActionSA, MK and the EFF, with Herman Mashaba in line to lead the city.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 09:27:46 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/johannesburg-council-to-elect-mayor-as-coalition-deal-gives-2c295b/share.jpg" length="43619" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/johannesburg-council-to-elect-mayor-as-coalition-deal-gives-2c295b/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
