<item><title>Brazilian police find more than 600kg of cocaine in cartel investigation</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/brazilian-police-find-more-than-600kg-of-cocaine-in-cartel-2070d2/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/brazilian-police-find-more-than-600kg-of-cocaine-in-cartel-2070d2/</guid><category>South Africa</category><description>The probe began after Australian pilot Timothy Clark crashed in Brazil in 2025 with 202kg of cocaine aboard an aircraft flown from South Africa.</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 21:56:37 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/za.jpg" length="36666" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/za.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
